" that is infinitely high and infinitely narrow, yet has a total integral of exactly 1.','<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.351ex\" height=\"2.564ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -883.2 7669 1133.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D70C\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-B-1D42B\" d=\"M405 293T374 293T324 312T305 361Q305 378 312 394Q315 397 315 399Q305 399 294 394T266 375T238 329T222 249Q221 241 221 149V62H308V0H298Q280 3 161 3Q47 3 38 0H29V62H98V210V303Q98 353 96 363T83 376Q69 380 42 380H29V442H32L118 446Q204 450 205 450H210V414L211 378Q247 449 315 449H321Q384 449 413 422T442 360Q442 332 424 313Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D45E\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q340 441 372 389Q373 390 37