y translation known as Drift. The most fundamental of these is the <svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.327ex\" height=\"1.552ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -686 2796.4 686\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-B-1D404\" d=\"M723 286Q721 284 700 145T677 3V0H39V62H147V618H39V680H660V676Q662 670 675 552T691 428V424H629V428Q629 429 627 448T618 494T601 541Q574 593 527 605T382 618H374H304V384H336Q338 384 347 384T361 384T376 386T392 390T407 397T421 407T432 423Q442 444 443 482V501H505V205H443V224Q442 258 435 278T411 307T380 318T336 322H304V62H375H394Q429 62 449 62T497 66T541 76T577 95T609 126T632 170T651 232Q661 287 661 289H723V286Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-D7\" d=\"M630 29Q630 9 609 9Q604 9 587 25T493 118L389 222L284 117Q178 13 175 11Q171 9 168 9Q160 9 154 15T147 29Q147 36 161 51T255 146L359 250L255 354Q174 435 161 449T147 471Q147 480 153 485T168 490Q173 490 175 489Q178 487 284 383L389 278L493 382Q570 459 587 475T609 491Q630 491 630 471Q630 464 620 453T522 355L418 250L522 145Q606 61 618 48T630 29Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-B-1D401\" d=\"M720 510Q720 476 704 448T665 404T619 377T580 362L564 359L583 356Q602 353 632 342T690 312Q712 292 725 276Q752 235 752 189V183Q752 160 741 125Q698 18 547 2Q543 1 288 0H39V62H147V624H39V686H264H409Q502 686 542 681T624 655Q720 607 720 510ZM563 513Q563 553 548 578T518 611T486 622Q479 624 385 624H293V382H375Q458 383 467 385Q563 405 563 513ZM590 192Q590 307 505 329Q504 330 503 330L398 331H293V62H391H400H444Q496 62 528 75T580 131Q590 155 590 192Z\"></path></defs><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D404\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-B-1D404\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(978.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX