=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(12671.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></svg>\n    In university-level theory, this Non-Separable State implies that the individual particles do not possess their own wave functions. This reveals that the causal structure of quantum mechanics is fundamentally holistic, challenging the Classical Postulate of reductionism.','<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -1.948ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"29.806ex\" height=\"5.027ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1361 13174.4 2222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-3A8\" d=\"M340 622Q338 623 335 625T331 629T325 631T314 634T298 635T274 636T239 637H212V683H224Q248 680 389 680T554 683H566V637H539Q479 637 464 635T439 622L438 407Q438 192 439 192Q443 193 449 195T474 207T507 232T536 276T557 344Q560 365 562 417T573 493Q587 536 620 544Q627 546 671 546H715L722 540V515Q714 509 708 509Q680 505 671 476T658 392T644 307Q599 177 451 153L438 151V106L439 61Q446 54 451 52T476 48T539 46H566V0H554Q530 3 389 3T224 0H212V46H239Q259 46 273 46T298 47T314 48T325 51T331 54T335 57T340 61V151Q126 178 117 406Q115 503 69 509Q55 509 55 526Q55 541 59 543T86 546H107H120Q150 546 161 543T184 528Q198 514 204 493Q212 472 213 420T226 316T272 230Q287 216 303 207T330 194L339 192Q340 192 340 407V622Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D465\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 15