xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(11544.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg>\n                This integral accounts for the varying velocity of the particle and the varying curvature of the spacetime it traverses. Unlike coordinate time, which is simply the difference between two timestamps, proper time is Path Dependent.','<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -2.268ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27.439ex\" height=\"6.14ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1711.3 12127.9 2713.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D70F\" d=\"M39 284Q18 284 18 294Q18 301 45 338T99 398Q134 425 164 429Q170 431 332 431Q492 431 497 429Q517 424 517 402Q517 388 508 376T485 360Q479 358 389 358T299 356Q298 355 283 274T251 109T233 20Q228 5 215 -4T186 -13Q153 -13 153 20V30L203 192Q214 228 227 272T248 336L254 357Q254 358 208 358Q206 358 197 358T183 359Q105 359 61 295Q56 287 53 286T39 284Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-LO-222B\" d=\"M114 -798Q132 -824 165 -824H167Q195 -824 223 -764T275 -600T320 -391T362 -164Q365 -143 367 -133Q439 292 523 655T645 1127Q651 1145 655 1157T672 1201T699 1257T733 1306T777 1346T828 1360Q884 1360 912 1325T944 1245Q944 1220 932 1205T909 1186T887 1183Q866 1183 849 1198T832 1239Q832 1287 885 1296L882 1300Q879 1303 874 1307T866 1313Q851 1323 833 1323Q819 1323 807 1311T775 1255T736 1139T689 936T633 628Q574 293 510 -5T410 -437T355 -629Q278 -862 165 -862Q125 -862 92 -831T55 -746Q55 -711 74 -698T112 -685Q133 -685 150 -700T167 -741Q167 -789 114 -798Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D706\" d=\"M166 673Q166 685 183 694H202Q292 691 316 644Q322 629 373 486T474 207T524 67Q531 47 537 34T546 15T551 6T55