C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-223C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" transform=\"translate(2555.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"A0\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-A0\"></use><use data-c=\"47\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-47\" transform=\"translate(250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(1035,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-1-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(1479,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg>), making it potentially testable at the Large Hadron Collider (LHC). It relies on the rapid movement of Higgs field \"bubbles\" to create a non-equilibrium environment where Sphalerons can forge matter from leptons.','<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.825ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4784.8 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-223C\" d=\"M55 166Q55 241 101 304T222 367Q260 367 296 349T362 304T421 252T484 208T554 189Q616 189 655 236T694 338Q694 350 698 358T708 367Q722 367 722 334Q722 260 677 197T562 134H554Q517 134 481 152T414 196T355 248T292 293T223 311Q179 311 145 286Q109 257 96 218T80 156T69 133Q55 133 55 166Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 32