(2010458,'cp-violating-phase','leptons','The CP-Violating Phase (\\( \\delta_{CP} \\))','<p>The <strong>CP-Violating Phase</strong> (\\( \\delta_{CP} \\)) is a fundamental parameter in the PMNS Matrix that allows for a physical difference between the behavior of matter and antimatter in the lepton sector.</p>','The CP-Violating Phase is a fundamental parameter in the PMNS Matrix that allows for a physical difference between the behavior of matter and antimatter in the lepton sector.','The CP-Violating Phase (<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.61ex\" height=\"1.997ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -717 1595.4 882.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D6FF\" d=\"M195 609Q195 656 227 686T302 717Q319 716 351 709T407 697T433 690Q451 682 451 662Q451 644 438 628T403 612Q382 612 348 641T288 671T249 657T235 628Q235 584 334 463Q401 379 401 292Q401 169 340 80T205 -10H198Q127 -10 83 36T36 153Q36 286 151 382Q191 413 252 434Q252 435 245 449T230 481T214 521T201 566T195 609ZM112 130Q112 83 136 55T204 27Q233 27 256 51T291 111T309 178T316 232Q316 267 309 298T295 344T269 400L259 396Q215 381 183 342T137 256T118 179T112 130Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D436\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D443\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321