(2010462,'lepton-flavor-universality','leptons','Lepton Flavor Universality (LFU)','<p>Lepton Flavor Universality (LFU) is a fundamental assumption of the Standard Model stating that the coupling of the gauge bosons (\\( \\gamma, W, Z \\)) is identical for all three generations of <strong>Leptons</strong>.</p>','Lepton Flavor Universality (LFU) is a fundamental assumption of the Standard Model stating that the coupling of the gauge bosons is identical for all three generations of Leptons.','Lepton Flavor Universality (LFU) is a fundamental assumption of the Standard Model stating that the coupling of the gauge bosons (<svg style=\"color: #FFD700; vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.247ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3203.3 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D6FE\" d=\"M31 249Q11 249 11 258Q11 275 26 304T66 365T129 418T206 441Q233 441 239 440Q287 429 318 386T371 255Q385 195 385 170Q385 166 386 166L398 193Q418 244 443 300T486 391T508 430Q510 431 524 431H537Q543 425 543 422Q543 418 522 378T463 251T391 71Q385 55 378 6T357 -100Q341 -165 330 -190T303 -216Q286 -216 286 -188Q286 -138 340 32L346 51L347 69Q348 79 348 100Q348 257 291 317Q251 355 196 355Q148 355 108 329T51 260Q49 251 47 251Q45 249 31 249Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-N-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path><path id=\"MJX-1-TEX-I-1D44A\" d=\"M436 683Q450 683 486 682T553 680Q604 680 638 681T677 682Q695 682 695 674Q695 670 692 659Q687 641 683 639T661 637Q636 636 621 632T600 624T597 615Q597 603 613 377T629 138L631 141Q633 144 637 151T649 170T666 200T690 241T720 295T759 362Q863 546 877 572T892 604Q892 619 873 628T831 637Q817 637 817 647Q817 650 819 660Q823 676 825 679T839 682Q842 682 856 682T895